## 6. Validation

HTML5 / MVC rules on: [ctl:text-configuration-id-configuration-i], [ctl:ConfigId], [ctl:ConfigName], [ctl:OwnerName], [ctl:text-page] (see §5 rules).

## 7. Interaction styles (measured on the live page)
No hover/focus style changes measured.

